2024-11-19T12:00:41 --------------------------
2024-11-19T12:00:41 |From fd848f0d43b843c66aaf43c2861ba8e31cebc1e8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
2024-11-19T12:00:41 |From: bluhm <bluhm@openbsd.org>
2024-11-19T12:00:41 |Date: Sat, 8 Jul 2023 14:49:55 +0000
2024-11-19T12:00:41 |Subject: [PATCH] Fix Perl tests in OpenBSD regress.
2024-11-19T12:00:41 |
2024-11-19T12:00:41 |Disable Perl test t/porting/exec-bit.t as it only checks permissions.
2024-11-19T12:00:41 |The x-bit in OpenBSD CVS tree does not match Perl distribution tar.
2024-11-19T12:00:41 |This is known and accepted.
2024-11-19T12:00:41 |
2024-11-19T12:00:41 |Set permission of Test-Harness source.sh and source_args.sh to
2024-11-19T12:00:41 |executable as Perl uses it to test module features. Stay close to
2024-11-19T12:00:41 |upstream. During regress, set the x-bit of the files in obj
2024-11-19T12:00:41 |directory. Do not touch src tree, it might be read-only.
2024-11-19T12:00:41 |
2024-11-19T12:00:41 |discussed with anton@; OK afresh1@
2024-11-19T12:00:41 |---
2024-11-19T12:00:41 | gnu/usr.bin/perl/t/porting/exec-bit.t | 4 ++++
2024-11-19T12:00:41 | regress/gnu/usr.bin/perl/Makefile | 20 ++++++++++++--------
2024-11-19T12:00:41 | 2 files changed, 16 insertions(+), 8 deletions(-)
2024-11-19T12:00:41 |
2024-11-19T12:00:41 |diff --git a/gnu/usr.bin/perl/t/porting/exec-bit.t b/gnu/usr.bin/perl/t/porting/exec-bit.t
2024-11-19T12:00:41 |index 3e80f844797..2dd2a662b57 100644
2024-11-19T12:00:41 |--- ./t/porting/exec-bit.t.orig Mon Feb 26 16:50:16 2024
2024-11-19T12:00:41 |+++ ./t/porting/exec-bit.t Thu Oct 24 01:55:40 2024
2024-11-19T12:00:41 --------------------------
